                <a data-w-tab="Tab 2" data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268a&quot;,&quot;6ed41236-811b-8e6b-4611-468e48e1b375&quot;],[]]]" class="about-mission-tab is-bar w-inline-block w-tab-link">
                  <div class="about-mission-tab-label">Our Vision</div>
                </a>
                <a data-w-tab="Tab 3" data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268a&quot;,&quot;6ed41236-811b-8e6b-4611-468e48e1b378&quot;],[]]]" class="about-mission-tab is-bar w-inline-block w-tab-link">
                  <div class="about-mission-tab-label">Our Values</div>
                </a>
              </div>
              <div class="about-mission-content w-tab-content">
                <div data-w-tab="Tab 1" data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268a&quot;,&quot;6ed41236-811b-8e6b-4611-468e48e1b37c&quot;],[]]]" class="about-mission-panel w-tab-pane w--tab-active">
                  <div class="about-mission-pane">
                    <div class="about-mission-text-block">
                      <div class="about-mission-text">
                        <h2 section-title="" class="heading-style-2">Our Mission</h2>
                        <p reveal-anim-2="" class="about-mission-summary">Before a single agent goes live, we sit down with your team to map what the workflow actually needs. What it has to do. Where it can flex. What can&#x27;t move. The automation that comes out of that conversation isn&#x27;t a guess dressed up as a product. It&#x27;s a direction your whole team already believes in.</p>
                      </div>
                      <a data-wf-target="[[[&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;,&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;],[&quot;3a5a1daa-03eb-e567-336d-cc3b9abdb109&quot;]]]" data-wf-component-id="2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7" data-wf-variant-state="base" {...link('/contact', 'secondary-button w-inline-block')}>
                        <div class="button-text-mask">
                          <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;,&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe9&quot;],[&quot;3a5a1daa-03eb-e567-336d-cc3b9abdb109&quot;]]]" class="button-text">Get In Touch</div>
                          <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;,&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffeb&quot;],[&quot;3a5a1daa-03eb-e567-336d-cc3b9abdb109&quot;]]]" class="button-text is-hover">Get In Touch</div>
                        </div>
                      </a>
                    </div><img src="/images/synthora-about-mission_1synthora-about-mission.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1028px) 100vw, 1028px" srcset="/images/synthora-about-mission_1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/synthora-about-mission_1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/synthora-about-mission_1synthora-about-mission.webp 1028w" alt="Two colleagues reviewing code together on a desktop monitor" class="about-mission-image">
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-w-tab="Tab 2" data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268a&quot;,&quot;6ed41236-811b-8e6b-4611-468e48e1b37d&quot;],[]]]" class="about-mission-panel is-next w-tab-pane">
                  <div class="about-mission-pane">
                    <div class="about-mission-text-block">
                      <div class="about-mission-text">
                        <h2 section-title="" class="heading-style-2">Our Vision</h2>
                        <p reveal-anim-2="" class="about-mission-summary">We picture a workplace where repetitive work runs itself. Every team, from finance to support, should be able to hand routine tasks to reliable AI agents and spend its time on decisions, customers and ideas. Synthora exists to make that shift simple, safe and measurable for companies of every size.</p>
                      </div>
                      <a data-wf-target="[[[&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;,&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;],[&quot;3fd3ef76-ff6c-a970-cd1a-4027b083a055&quot;]]]" data-wf-component-id="2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7" data-wf-variant-state="base" {...link('/contact', 'secondary-button w-inline-block')}>
                        <div class="button-text-mask">
                          <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;,&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe9&quot;],[&quot;3fd3ef76-ff6c-a970-cd1a-4027b083a055&quot;]]]" class="button-text">Get In Touch</div>
                          <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;,&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffeb&quot;],[&quot;3fd3ef76-ff6c-a970-cd1a-4027b083a055&quot;]]]" class="button-text is-hover">Get In Touch</div>
                        </div>
                      </a>
                    </div><img src="/images/synthora-about-hero_1synthora-about-hero.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/synthora-about-hero_1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/synthora-about-hero_1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/synthora-about-hero_1-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/synthora-about-hero_1-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/synthora-about-hero_1-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/synthora-about-hero_1-p-2600.webp 2600w, /images/synthora-about-hero_1synthora-about-hero.webp 2744w" alt="Synthora team planning a project around a shared office table" class="about-mission-image">
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div data-w-tab="Tab 3" data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6b03d9375de33e5d414c268a&quot;,&quot;6ed41236-811b-8e6b-4611-468e48e1b37e&quot;],[]]]" class="about-mission-panel is-next w-tab-pane">
                  <div class="about-mission-pane">
                    <div class="about-mission-text-block">
                      <div class="about-mission-text">
                        <h2 section-title="" class="heading-style-2">Our Values</h2>
                        <p reveal-anim-2="" class="about-mission-summary">We build in the open, ship carefully and measure everything. Security and privacy come first, models stay swappable so you are never locked in, and every agent we help launch has a clear owner, clear limits and a clear result it is accountable for.</p>
                      </div>
                      <a data-wf-target="[[[&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;,&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;],[&quot;55aeed34-fc31-01f8-04bc-4ec3c1de7880&quot;]]]" data-wf-component-id="2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7" data-wf-variant-state="base" {...link('/contact', 'secondary-button w-inline-block')}>
                        <div class="button-text-mask">
                          <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;,&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe9&quot;],[&quot;55aeed34-fc31-01f8-04bc-4ec3c1de7880&quot;]]]" class="button-text">Get In Touch</div>
                          <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffe7&quot;,&quot;2327f0b1-22dd-4a01-6298-d1f19bcbffeb&quot;],[&quot;55aeed34-fc31-01f8-04bc-4ec3c1de7880&quot;]]]" class="button-text is-hover">Get In Touch</div>
                        </div>
                      </a>
                    </div><img src="/images/synthora-about-mission_1synthora-about-mission.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/synthora-about-mission_1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/synthora-about-mission_1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/synthora-about-mission_1synthora-about-mission.webp 1028w" alt="Engineers pairing on an AI workflow at a desk" class="about-mission-image">
                  </div>
